# Start the API with the https profile, then run "Get accounts" first:
# the other requests use the first account it returns (Checking).

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7102
@checkingId = {{accounts.response.body.$[0].id}}

### Get accounts

# @name accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts

### Invalid amount

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{checkingId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": -100
}

### Insufficient funds

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{checkingId}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "amount": 1000000
}

### Account not found

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Same account transfer

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{checkingId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{checkingId}}",
  "amount": 100
}

### Missing idempotency key (400 idempotency_key_required)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{checkingId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10
}

### Idempotent deposit: send this twice. The second response replays the
### first and the balance only changes once.

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{checkingId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555

{
  "amount": 10
}

### Same key, different amount (422 idempotency_key_conflict)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{checkingId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555

{
  "amount": 20
}

### Unknown endpoint

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown

### Unsupported content type

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{checkingId}}/deposits
Content-Type: text/plain

150

### Malformed JSON

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{checkingId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount":

### Allowed CORS origin

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Origin: https://localhost:7101

### Disallowed CORS origin

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Origin: https://untrusted.example.com

### CORS preflight

OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Origin: https://localhost:7101
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type, idempotency-key